WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.520
SCP-173: It’s a Sculpture so scary&nbsp;
that even 682 feels nervous around it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.360
Wanna know how to beat SCP-173 if&nbsp;
you ever go toe-to-foot-nub with it?&nbsp;

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.520
The first step is confidence and positive&nbsp;
thinking. Take a deep breath, smile wide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.480
and don’t let that big, gnarly,&nbsp;
concrete peanut get in your head.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.480
Next, choose your battlefield wisely. Anywhere&nbsp;
dark is just going to get your head twisted like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.400
a bottle cap. A bright space with plenty&nbsp;
of corners you can run around is ideal.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.680
Of course, practice helps, too. Have&nbsp;
plenty of staring contests with your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.160
friends, and play SCP Containment Breach&nbsp;
religiously for valuable battle simulations.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.920
If 173 is kind enough to let you&nbsp;
pick the battle, we suggest limbo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.400
and would advise heavily against challenging it&nbsp;
to a game of tag, because it will definitely win.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.160
And most important of all...Blink&nbsp;
one eye at a time, that way you can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.600
always keep one eye on it at all&nbsp;
times, keeping it frozen in place.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:54.160
Now you know how to beat SCP-173. Which&nbsp;
is great….because it’s right behind you!

